19:["$","$L1f",null,{"slides":[{"src":"/images/google-workspace/module-6/organize-labels-filters-search/slide-01.jpg","alt":"Labels, not folders: one message can have several labels"},{"src":"/images/google-workspace/module-6/organize-labels-filters-search/slide-02.jpg","alt":"Create and apply a label"},{"src":"/images/google-workspace/module-6/organize-labels-filters-search/slide-03.jpg","alt":"Search operators: find anything in seconds"},{"src":"/images/google-workspace/module-6/organize-labels-filters-search/slide-04.jpg","alt":"Filters: rules that sort mail as it arrives"},{"src":"/images/google-workspace/module-6/organize-labels-filters-search/slide-05.jpg","alt":"Snooze: make a message come back later"},{"src":"/images/google-workspace/module-6/organize-labels-filters-search/slide-06.jpg","alt":"Quick check: match the operator"}]}]
1a:["$","div",null,{"className":"mb-12","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"mb-8","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"font-display text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-ink sm:text-[40px] sm:leading-[1.05]","children":"Lesson Notes"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-3 max-w-3xl text-lg leading-relaxed text-ink-soft","children":"Read through the key concepts before you try the challenge."}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"bg-white rounded-2xl shadow-md border border-gray-200 p-8","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"space-y-12","children":[["$","div","0",{"children":[["$","h3",null,{"className":"text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-6","children":"Labels instead of folders"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"space-y-6","children":[["$","div","0",{"className":"rounded-xl border border-amber-200 bg-amber-50 p-6","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"block text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-amber-800 mb-2","children":"On the job"}],"$undefined",["$","p",null,{"className":"text-sm font-medium text-amber-900 mb-2","children":"You keep the Parkview office mailbox organized."}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-gray-800 leading-relaxed","children":"Vendor invoices from Russo Plumbing and Bright Clean Services are scattered through the inbox. Denise wants all vendor mail in one place, out of the inbox, without losing anything, and Grace Holloway's question about the roof estimate shouldn't clutter your inbox until the estimate is ready."}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-3 pt-3 border-t border-amber-200 text-gray-900","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"font-semibold","children":"Your task: "}],"Set up Gmail so vendor mail sorts itself and nothing slips through the cracks."]}]]}],["$","p","1",{"className":"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed","children":"Gmail organizes mail with labels. A label works like a tag: one conversation can have several labels, such as Vendors and Elm Street Apartments, and still be in the inbox. A folder can only hold a message in one place. Labels are private: only you see the labels you put on your mail, and the people you write to don't."}],["$","ol","2",{"start":"$undefined","className":"list-decimal pl-6 space-y-3 text-gray-700 marker:font-semibold marker:text-primary-600","children":[["$","li","0",{"className":"leading-relaxed pl-1","children":"To create a label, on the left next to Labels, select Create new label (+). Enter a name and select Create. To put it inside another label, check Nest label under and pick the parent."}],["$","li","1",{"className":"leading-relaxed pl-1","children":"To label a conversation, check the box next to it (or open it), select Labels (the tag icon) at the top, check the label, and select Apply."}],["$","li","2",{"className":"leading-relaxed pl-1","children":"To move a conversation to a label, select Move to instead. Move to adds the label and takes the conversation out of the inbox."}],["$","li","3",{"className":"leading-relaxed pl-1","children":"To see everything with a label, select the label on the left."}]]}],["$","div","3",{"className":"p-4 rounded-xl border-l-4 text-gray-800 leading-relaxed bg-blue-50 border-blue-400","children":[false,"If you're used to Outlook, a Gmail label is like a folder you can use more than once, and a Gmail filter is like an Outlook rule."]}]]}]]}],["$","div","1",{"children":[["$","h3",null,{"className":"text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-6","children":"Search like a pro"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"space-y-6","children":[["$","p","0",{"className":"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed","children":"Type in Search mail at the top and press Enter. Plain words search everything. Search operators narrow it down. You can combine them: from:russo has:attachment finds only Russo Plumbing messages with attachments."}],"$L20","$L21"]}]]}],"$L22","$L23","$L24"]}]}]]}]
1b:["$","div",null,{"id":"practice-simulation","className":"mb-12 scroll-mt-24","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"mb-8","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"font-display text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-ink sm:text-[40px] sm:leading-[1.05]","children":"Practice Simulation"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-3 max-w-3xl text-lg leading-relaxed text-ink-soft","children":"Practice what this lesson taught in a working copy of the app. Tasks appear under the window, just like GMetrix."}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"space-y-10","style":{"width":"min(1360px, calc(100vw - 2rem))","marginLeft":"calc((100% - min(1360px, calc(100vw - 2rem))) / 2)"},"children":[["$","$L25","gw-m6-organize-labels-filters-search-1",{"sim":{"id":"gw-m6-organize-labels-filters-search-1","app":"gmail","title":"Organize vendor mail with labels, search and a filter","scenario":"Vendor invoices keep getting buried. Denise asks you to keep every vendor message together and out of the way until you need it.","fileName":"Gmail","minutes":7,"initial":{"surface":"mail","me":{"name":"Jordan Lee","email":"jlee@parkviewpm.example","color":"#1a73e8"},"people":[{"name":"Denise Carter","email":"dcarter@parkviewpm.example","color":"#188038","contact":true},{"name":"Marcus Reyes","email":"mreyes@parkviewpm.example","color":"#e8710a","contact":true},{"name":"Kim Nguyen","email":"knguyen@parkviewpm.example","color":"#9334e6","contact":true},{"name":"Priya Shah","email":"pshah@parkviewpm.example","color":"#d93025","contact":true},{"name":"Andre Wallace","email":"awallace@parkviewpm.example","color":"#12858a","contact":true},{"name":"Tony Russo","email":"tony@russoplumbing.example","color":"#b06000","contact":true},{"name":"Grace Holloway","email":"gholloway@harborviewholdings.example","contact":true},{"name":"Darnell Brooks","email":"dbrooks@example.com","contact":true},{"name":"Rosa Delgado","email":"rdelgado@example.com"},{"name":"Tina Okafor","email":"tokafor@example.com","contact":true},{"name":"Sam Whitfield","email":"swhitfield@example.com","contact":true},{"name":"Bright Clean Services","email":"office@brightclean.example","contact":true},{"name":"City Water Utility","email":"billing@citywater.example"},{"name":"Office Supply Depot","email":"deals@officesupplydepot.example"},{"name":"Neighborly","email":"notifications@neighborly.example"},{"name":"Parkview IT Support","email":"it-support@parkview-pm-help.example"},{"name":"Rewards Center","email":"winner@claim-rewards-now.example"},{"name":"Landlord Learning Hub","email":"news@landlordlearninghub.example"}],"org":{"name":"Parkview Property Management","domain":"parkviewpm.example"},"messages":[{"to":["jlee@parkviewpm.example"],"box":"inbox","id":"m1","from":"dcarter@parkviewpm.example","subject":"Welcome aboard, Jordan!","date":"2026-10-21T08:05","starred":false,"unread":true,"important":true,"body":"Hi Jordan,\n\nWelcome to Parkview Property Management! Your first week is about learning our tools. Most of our work happens in Gmail, Calendar, Drive and Meet.\n\nPlease keep an eye on the shared Maintenance and Leasing threads, and ask me anything.\n\nDenise Carter\nOffice Manager"},{"to":["jlee@parkviewpm.example","dcarter@parkviewpm.example"],"box":"inbox","id":"m2","from":"awallace@parkviewpm.example","cc":["knguyen@parkviewpm.example"],"subject":"Showing at Elm Street Apartments moved to Thursday","date":"2026-10-21T09:12","unread":true,"body":"Hi all,\n\nThe prospective tenant for Elm Street Apartments, Unit 2B asked to move Wednesday's showing to Thursday at 4:00 PM. Kim, can someone unlock the side door before then?\n\nThanks,\nAndre"},{"to":["jlee@parkviewpm.example"],"box":"inbox","id":"m3","from":"pshah@parkviewpm.example","subject":"October rent roll","date":"2026-10-20T16:40","body":"Hi Jordan,\n\nAttached is the October rent roll. Please don't forward it outside the office: it lists every tenant's balance.\n\nPriya","attachments":[{"name":"Rent Roll - October.xlsx","size":"48 KB"}]},{"to":["jlee@parkviewpm.example"],"box":"inbox","id":"m4","from":"knguyen@parkviewpm.example","subject":"Pest control visit, Riverside Commons","date":"2026-10-20T11:03","body":"FYI, the pest control company will spray the basement at Riverside Commons next Tuesday morning. No action needed from the office.\n\nKim"},{"to":["jlee@parkviewpm.example"],"box":"inbox","id":"m5","from":"deals@officesupplydepot.example","subject":"30% off printer paper this week","date":"2026-10-21T06:30","category":"Promotions","unread":true,"unsubscribe":true,"body":"Stock up and save: 30% off copy paper, toner and file folders through Sunday."},{"to":["jlee@parkviewpm.example"],"box":"inbox","id":"m6","from":"notifications@neighborly.example","subject":"3 neighbors posted near Elm Street","date":"2026-10-20T19:22","category":"Social","unread":true,"body":"See what your neighbors are saying: a lost cat, a yard sale and a question about recycling day."},{"to":["jlee@parkviewpm.example"],"box":"inbox","id":"m7","from":"billing@citywater.example","subject":"Your October statement is ready","date":"2026-10-19T07:15","category":"Updates","body":"Your October water statement for account 55-1208 (Riverside Commons) is ready to view. Amount due: $412.60."},{"to":["jlee@parkviewpm.example"],"box":"inbox","id":"m8","from":"tony@russoplumbing.example","subject":"Invoice #4471 for Elm Street Apartments","date":"2026-10-19T14:50","body":"Hello,\n\nPlease find attached invoice #4471 for the kitchen sink repair at Elm Street Apartments, Unit 2B, completed October 16.\n\nTony Russo\nRusso Plumbing","attachments":[{"name":"Invoice 4471.pdf","size":"212 KB"}]},{"to":["jlee@parkviewpm.example"],"box":"inbox","id":"m9","from":"tony@russoplumbing.example","subject":"Invoice #4480 for Riverside Commons","date":"2026-10-16T10:20","body":"Invoice #4480 for the water heater inspection at Riverside Commons is attached.","attachments":[{"name":"Invoice 4480.pdf","size":"198 KB"}]},{"to":["jlee@parkviewpm.example"],"box":"inbox","id":"m10","from":"office@brightclean.example","subject":"Hallway carpet cleaning, Elm Street Apartments","date":"2026-10-21T07:48","unread":true,"body":"We can clean the second-floor hallway carpet at Elm Street Apartments on Saturday. Please confirm by Thursday."},{"to":["jlee@parkviewpm.example"],"box":"inbox","id":"m11","from":"gholloway@harborviewholdings.example","subject":"Question about the roof estimate","date":"2026-10-21T09:40","unread":true,"body":"Hi Jordan, when will the roof estimate for Riverside Commons be ready? Thanks, Grace"},{"to":["jlee@parkviewpm.example"],"box":"archive","id":"m12","from":"tony@russoplumbing.example","subject":"Technician running 10 minutes late","date":"2026-10-15T08:02","body":"Our technician is running about 10 minutes late to Elm Street Apartments."}],"labels":[],"settings":{"categories":["Primary","Promotions","Social","Updates"]},"view":{"folder":"inbox","tab":"Primary"}},"tasks":[{"instruction":"Create a label named “Vendors”.","hint":"In the left menu, next to Labels, select Create new label (+). Type Vendors and select Create.","steps":[{"action":{"kind":"type","target":"newlabel","value":"Vendors"}}]},{"instruction":"Apply the Vendors label to the Bright Clean Services message “Hallway carpet cleaning, Elm Street Apartments.” Keep it in the inbox.","hint":"Check the box next to the message › Labels (tag icon) at the top › check Vendors › Apply.","steps":[{"action":{"kind":"command","id":"gm.labels","value":"Vendors"},"requires":{"selection":"msg:m10"},"selectHint":"Check the box next to the Bright Clean Services message first."}]},{"instruction":"Use search operators to find every message from Russo Plumbing that has an attachment.","hint":"In Search mail, type from:russo has:attachment and press Enter.","steps":[{"action":{"kind":"command","id":"gm.search","value":["from:russo has:attachment","from:russoplumbing has:attachment","from:russoplumbing.example has:attachment","from:tony@russoplumbing.example has:attachment","from:\"russo plumbing\" has:attachment","from:(russo plumbing) has:attachment"]}}]},{"instruction":"Create a filter for mail from tony@russoplumbing.example that skips the inbox and applies the Vendors label. Apply it to the matching conversations too.","hint":"Search box › Show search options (sliders icon) › From: tony@russoplumbing.example › Create filter › check Skip the Inbox (Archive it) › check Apply the label and choose Vendors › check Also apply filter to … matching conversations › Create filter.","steps":[{"action":{"kind":"type","target":"filter","value":"From: tony@russoplumbing.example\nSkip the Inbox (Archive it)\nApply the label: Vendors\nAlso apply filter to matching conversations","match":"includes"},"alt":[{"kind":"type","target":"filter","value":["From: tony@russoplumbing.example","Skip the Inbox (Archive it)","Apply the label: Vendors","Also apply filter to matching conversations"],"match":"all"},{"kind":"type","target":"filter","value":["From: russoplumbing.example","Skip the Inbox (Archive it)","Apply the label: Vendors","Also apply filter to matching conversations"],"match":"all"},{"kind":"type","target":"filter","value":["From: russo","Skip the Inbox (Archive it)","Apply the label: Vendors","Also apply filter to matching conversations"],"match":"all"}]}]},{"instruction":"Open the Vendors label to check that the Russo Plumbing messages and the Bright Clean message are all there.","hint":"In the left menu under Labels, select Vendors.","steps":[{"action":{"kind":"command","id":"gm.go","value":"label:Vendors"}}]},{"instruction":"Go back to the inbox and snooze Grace Holloway's message “Question about the roof estimate” until tomorrow. You'll have the estimate then.","hint":"Inbox › point to Grace's message › Snooze (clock) › Tomorrow. Or open it and select Snooze at the top.","steps":[{"action":{"kind":"command","id":"gm.snooze","value":"Tomorrow"},"requires":{"selection":"msg:m11"},"selectHint":"Point to Grace Holloway's message (or check its box) before you choose Snooze."}]}]}}]]}]]}]
