22:["$","div","2",{"children":[["$","h3",null,{"className":"text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-6","children":"Filters sort mail as it arrives"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"space-y-6","children":[["$","p","0",{"className":"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed","children":"A filter is a rule Gmail runs on new mail. It checks each message against your search and then does what you chose: skip the inbox (archive it), mark it as read, star it, apply a label, forward it, delete it, never send it to Spam, always or never mark it as important, or put it in a category."}],["$","ol","1",{"start":"$undefined","className":"list-decimal pl-6 space-y-3 text-gray-700 marker:font-semibold marker:text-primary-600","children":[["$","li","0",{"className":"leading-relaxed pl-1","children":"In the search box, select Show search options (the sliders icon)."}],["$","li","1",{"className":"leading-relaxed pl-1","children":"Fill in what to look for, such as From: tony@russoplumbing.example. Select Search first if you want to preview the matches."}],["$","li","2",{"className":"leading-relaxed pl-1","children":"Select Create filter."}],["$","li","3",{"className":"leading-relaxed pl-1","children":"Check what the filter should do, for example Skip the Inbox (Archive it) and Apply the label: Vendors."}],["$","li","4",{"className":"leading-relaxed pl-1","children":"To sort the mail you already have too, check Also apply filter to matching conversations."}],["$","li","5",{"className":"leading-relaxed pl-1","children":"Select Create filter."}]]}],["$","p","2",{"className":"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed","children":"You can also start a filter from a message: check the box next to it, select More (three dots), and choose Filter messages like these. To change or remove a filter later, go to Settings › See all settings › Filters and Blocked Addresses, and select edit or delete next to it."}],["$","div","3",{"className":"p-4 rounded-xl border-l-4 text-gray-800 leading-relaxed bg-yellow-50 border-yellow-400","children":[false,"Be careful with Delete it and Skip the Inbox. A filter that's too broad (for example, everything with the word “invoice”) can hide messages you needed. Test the search first and look at what it finds."]}]]}]]}]
